\\n---\\nWe cannot provide a description for this page right now\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4fc13b119e6ec230\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"86f86db046a5c9a0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRailway transport - Transport - Eurostat - European Commission\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"86f86db046a5c9a0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/transport/information-data/railway-transport\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ec91e9288e7a875a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEurostat publishes annual data on the length of railway lines equipped with the European rail traffic management system (ERTMS). This is a European signalling and speed-control system that aims to enhance safety, as well as efficiency and cross-border interoperability of rail transport in Europe.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ec91e9288e7a875a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5c9ecf04e3640c89\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">Characteristics of the railway network in Europe</span>\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5c9ecf04e3640c89\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Characteristics_of_the_railway_network_in_Europe\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7240b1f05db907b5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe policy of the Trans-European Transport Network (TEN-T) states that ERTMS shall be deployed in full on the TEN-T railway network by 2030. Out of the 18 EU countries for which data on ETCS deployment are available for 2025, the use of ETCS level 1 (track-based) signalling system was the unique choice in Bulgaria, Croatia, Luxembourg and Slovenia, the predominant choice in Belgium, Spain, Romania, Slovakia and Switzerland (Table 2).\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7240b1f05db907b5\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"93af19d1f2164180\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEuropa\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"93af19d1f2164180\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tran_sf_railsu/default/table?lang=en\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f99df297111860f1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n{{navtreeTabShown | uppercase}} · Toast-notifications available (click to show all) · ({{notificationCount}}) · Go back to the LIVE environment · PREVIEW EC data browser\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f99df297111860f1\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"22fb9e1418358cbd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRailway safety statistics in the EU - Statistics Explained - Eurostat\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"22fb9e1418358cbd\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Railway_safety_statistics_in_the_EU&oldid=551866\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"79f94b332aab1852\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTable 4: Suicides on railway premises, 2010-2023 (number) Source: Eurostat (tran_sf_railsu)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"79f94b332aab1852\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 10, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"39f0d7b5a50ac024\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRail accident fatalities in the EU - Statistics Explained\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"39f0d7b5a50ac024\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/Rail_accident_fatalities_in_the_EU\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"31b94466069ea30a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRailway accidents, EU-27, 2010-2018 Source: Eurostat (tran_sf_railac) In 2018, 1 666 significant railway accidents were reported in the EU-27. A total of 853 persons were killed in these accidents, while another 748 persons were seriously injured. At EU level, the number of fatalities in railway accidents decreased gradually from 1 245 in 2010 to 853 in 2018.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"31b94466069ea30a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "site:ec.europa.eu/eurostat tran_sf_railsu Germany France Spain Belgium Portugal Croatia Bulgaria UK number 2014 2020", "provider": "brave", "count": 10, "tookMs": 879, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e6ac869b1ca0c95e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n[tran_sf_railsu] Suicides involving railways - European Commission\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e6ac869b1ca0c95e\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tran_sf_railsu/default/table?lang=en&category=tran.tran_sf.tran_sf_rail", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0e4adc8077f1fce1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n{{navtreeTabShown | uppercase}} · Toast-notifications available (click to show all) · ({{notificationCount}}) · Go back to the LIVE environment · PREVIEW EC data browser\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0e4adc8077f1fce1\">>>", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"58479099efefe994\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRailway safety statistics in the EU - European Commission\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"58479099efefe994\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/Railway_safety_statistics_in_the_EU", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_C