UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"93af19d1f2164180\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tran_sf_railsu/default/table?lang=en", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f99df297111860f1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n{{navtreeTabShown | uppercase}} · Toast-notifications available (click to show all) · ({{notificationCount}}) · Go back to the LIVE environment · PREVIEW EC data browser\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f99df297111860f1\">>>", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"22fb9e1418358cbd\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRailway safety statistics in the EU - Statistics Explained - Eurostat\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"22fb9e1418358cbd\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Railway_safety_statistics_in_the_EU&oldid=551866", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"79f94b332aab1852\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTable 4: Suicides on railway premises, 2010-2023 (number) Source: Eurostat (tran_sf_railsu)\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"79f94b332aab1852\">>>", "published": "January 10, 2023", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"39f0d7b5a50ac024\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRail accident fatalities in the EU - Statistics Explained\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"39f0d7b5a50ac024\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php/Rail_accident_fatalities_in_the_EU", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"31b94466069ea30a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRailway accidents, EU-27, 2010-2018 Source: Eurostat (tran_sf_railac) In 2018, 1 666 significant railway accidents were reported in the EU-27. A total of 853 persons were killed in these accidents, while another 748 persons were seriously injured. At EU level, the number of fatalities in railway accidents decreased gradually from 1 245 in 2010 to 853 in 2018.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"31b94466069ea30a\">>>", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1776057126199}}
